---
import { BadgeCheck, CalendarDays, Check, Heart } from '@lucide/astro';
---

<section class="px-0 py-[72px]" id="sobre" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-[640px]">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-accent-foreground">
        Clube Flex
      </p>
      <h2
        class="mt-2 font-display text-[clamp(32px,6vw,48px)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em]"
        id="about-title"
      >
        Mais que descontos. Uma rotina mais generosa.
      </h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <li class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-muted p-6">
        <span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[14px] border border-border bg-background text-accent-foreground">
          <BadgeCheck class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" stroke-width={1.75} />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-[18px] text-[19px] font-semibold">
          Parceiros selecionados
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-[1.5] text-foreground-soft">
          Clínicas, escolas e espaços de lazer escolhidos com cuidado para
          atender você e sua família.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-muted p-6">
        <span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[14px] border border-border bg-background text-accent-foreground">
          <Heart class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" stroke-width={1.75} />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-[18px] text-[19px] font-semibold">
          Benefícios de verdade
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-[1.5] text-foreground-soft">
          Descontos claros, de acordo com o seu plano, para usar no dia a dia.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-muted p-6">
        <span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[14px] border border-border bg-background text-accent-foreground">
          <Check class="h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true" stroke-width={1.75} />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-[18px] text-[19px] font-semibold">Sem complicação</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-[1.5] text-foreground-soft">
          Escolha o parceiro, siga as instruções de uso e aproveite.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-surface-muted p-6">
        <span class="grid h-12 w-12 place-items-center rounded-[14px] border border-border bg-background text-accent-foreground">
          <CalendarDays
            class="h-5 w-5"
            aria-hidden="true"
            stroke-width={1.75}
          />
        </span>
        <h3 class="mt-[18px] text-[19px] font-semibold">
          Atualizações mensais
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 leading-[1.5] text-foreground-soft">
          Novos parceiros e condições entram no catálogo com frequência.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
